# Real-data test fixture: 18 MB extract (44,568 peak groups x 29 sub-scores) from an Astral run.
# Deliberately NOT tracked -- it is large, permanent in history, and derived from run data.
# odia-lda-realdata-test SKIPS (ctest code 77) when it is absent, so a clone still passes.
# Regenerate by dumping FEATURE_MS2's VAR_ columns with the group id and decoy label; the format is
# "nrows ncols" then one "group label f0..fN" line per row.
testdata/lda_fixture.txt

